OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murder after bus
OL,4,Astop stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man has been found guilty
OL,7,Fof murder after fatally stabbing
OL,8,Fanother man at a bus stop.
OL,10,FMustafa Ali, from Fishponds, was
OL,11,Fconvicted of murdering 47-year-old Leon
OL,12,FPhillips following a majority verdict
OL,13,Fby a jury at Bristol Crown Court
OL,14,Fearlier.
OL,16,FAvon and Somerset Police said Ali was
OL,17,Fwith four other males when he stabbed
OL,18,FPhillips outside Maliks Supermarket on
OL,19,FStapleton Road on 2 February. Phillips
OL,20,Fdied in hospital on 3 February.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
