OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murder after bus
OL,4,Astop stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet ch insp Lucy Edgeworth said the
OL,7,Fcase was a "stark reminder of the
OL,8,Fdevastating impact that knife carrying
OL,9,Fcan have on individuals, families and
OL,10,Fcommunities".
